#X text 82 4696 The digital delay of the Poly-800 II (71-75) \, measured: echo \; in phase on the left output \, inverted on the right (a mono \; sum cancels it). dtim (30) 0-99 = 4.2 ms - 1.08 s (70: 216 \; ms) \, dfb (0) feedback 0-15 (15: -3.1 dB per echo) \, dmf (0) \; mod rate 0-31 = 0.05-5 Hz \, dmi (0) mod depth 0-31 (31: the \; time swings 1:5 \, about 10 dB less per 10 steps below) \, dlev \; (0) echo level 0-15 \, 0 = off. A gate ends the echo train\; \; changing a value mutes the echo for a moment \, as on the \; original. Presets: flanger (4 ms \, slow sweep \, feedback) \, \; chorus1 (fast \, shallow) \, chorus2 (slow \, wider) \, slap (120 \; ms) \, long (0.5 s with repeats) \, off., f 64;
