#X msg 60 5144 vamp \$1;
#X text 82 5182 Each voice's DCO1 and DCO2 have their own 6-stage DEG as on \; the Poly-800 (attack \, decay \, break point \, slope \, sustain \, \; release 0-31 \, setting one makes env1 / env2 -1). Measured on \; a Poly-800 II: level 0-31 is about (L/31)^2 \, attack rises \; linearly (31: about 9 s) \, decay \, slope and release fall at a \; constant dB per second (31: about 18 s to -40 dB). env1 / \; env2 (Controls) morph through: 0 gate / 1 short pluck / 24 \; pluck / 48 piano / 72 long release / 92 swell / 108 pad / \; 127 long pad. \; vamp (0) velocity to the level of each voice (both DCOs \, not \; on the Poly-800): 0 off \, 127 level = velocity., f 64;
#X obj 60 5386 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Portamento 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
