#X msg 160 5444 pmod \$1;
#X floatatom 260 5420 6 0 2 0 - - -;
#X msg 260 5444 mono \$1;
#X text 82 5482 Not on the Poly-800. port (0) glide time 0-127 = off to 3 s. \; pmod (0) where a glide starts: 0 from the last note played \, \; 1 from the note this voice played before \, 2 from the last \; note only while another key is still held (legato glide). \; mono (0) 0 poly (4 voices) \, 1 mono: one voice \, the last key \; wins \, every key restarts the envelopes \, 2 mono legato: only \; the first key of a phrase restarts them \, further keys (and \; going back to a held one) only change the pitch., f 64;
