#X text 82 5858 oct1 \, oct2 (0) -1 0 1 = LOW MID HIGH \, 2-4: the feet one to \; three octaves higher (the combinations without 16'). \; bnd (2) bend range in semitones (original: up to 7). \; treb \, bass (0) EQ -6..6 (76/77 \, measured: about 4 dB at 3 \, \; 10 dB at 6 \, shelves at 4.3 kHz and 115 Hz). \; sprd (0) stereo spread of the 4 voices 0-127. \; mrph (8) smoothing of har and lev changes in ms. \; ch1 (0) MIDI channel for p v ch lists \, 0 = any. \; tone (1) 1: output stage measured on a Poly-800 (54 Hz \; high-pass \, VCF \, 1 pole at 5 kHz) \, 0: raw tone generators. \; leak (0) 1: released voices stay at -55 dB \, as on the \; original., f 64;
